<pj-nav title="领取打印素材" back/><view class="page"><view class="title">把快乐带到纸上</view><view class="subtitle">{{resource.title}}</view><view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="state">正在确认领取方式…</view><view class="card" wx:if="{{resource &amp;&amp; !result}}"><view class="section-title">{{rewarded ? '观看完整视频后领取' : '免费领取'}}</view><view class="muted">{{rewarded ? '请完整观看激励视频。提前关闭不会解锁链接。' : '无需登录，领取后复制网盘链接下载文件。'}}</view><button class="primary" loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{busy}}" bindtap="claim">{{busy ? '正在处理…' : rewarded ? '观看视频并领取' : '获取下载链接'}}</button></view><view class="state" wx:if="{{error}}">{{error}}<button wx:if="{{!resource}}" bindtap="load">重新加载</button></view><block wx:if="{{result}}"><view class="section-title">选择网盘</view><view class="chip {{selected === index ? 'active' : ''}}" wx:for="{{result.links}}" wx:key="provider" data-index="{{index}}" bindtap="select">{{item.provider === 'baidu' ? '百度网盘' : '夸克网盘'}}</view><view class="card provider"><view class="section-title">{{result.links[selected].provider === 'baidu' ? '百度网盘' : '夸克网盘'}}</view><view class="body" selectable>{{result.links[selected].url}}</view><view wx:if="{{result.links[selected].extractionCode}}">提取码：<text selectable>{{result.links[selected].extractionCode}}</text></view><view class="actions"><button class="primary" bindtap="copy">复制链接与提取码</button><button wx:if="{{result.links[selected].extractionCode}}" bindtap="copyCode">仅复制码</button></view></view><view class="section-title">接下来怎么做</view><view class="body">1. 复制链接与提取码。
2. 打开对应网盘 App 或浏览器，粘贴链接。
3. 输入提取码，保存并下载文件。
4. 按素材说明选择 A4、黑白或彩色打印。</view><button bindtap="feedback">链接失效？反馈给我们</button></block><view class="foot">网盘可能需要对应服务的账号。小程序内不直接打开外部网盘。</view><button bindtap="free">返回发现，浏览更多素材</button></view>
